/bin/zsh -lc "cat > NOTES.md <<'EOF'
Kept every original scorer array unchanged. Added a four-layer ReLU branch with directions computed from means of messages I wrote. Fixed contrast projections remove unrelated wording and ordinary department-match signals. Two gated routes cover ordinary and card-type-invariant exchange-rate complaints. Additional contrasts check refund, pending, and unexplained-charge language. Hand-selected fractional margins and a five-logit cap limit the adjustment.

A [5,2] department bias uses the supplied scorer's broadcasting to disable the extra output for every option except fees_fx. All other option logits remain exactly unchanged on the checked vectors. build_scorer.py reads only the input weights and authored marker arrays. I used no training, optimizer, regression, least squares, or fitted solver.

Validation: 32/32 supplied evidence messages route correctly; all 16 supplied control predictions remain unchanged. All 10 additional exchange-rate checks and 10 control checks pass after the card-type refinement. These additional checks informed that refinement and are not an independent final test. Original-array, finite-weight, bonus-bound, and batch checks pass.

The hidden test set was unavailable. These checks do not prove universal correctness or preservation on every other message.
EOF
